    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukelenge Nebukadenesâ udi utuma dî kudi bantu bonso, ba bisamba bionso ne ba miaku yonso badi bashikame ha buloba buonso ne, Ditalala dikumbane kunudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakuelangana meji ne, Mbimpe bua meme kunumanyisha bua bimanyinu ne malu a kukema biakungenzela Nzambi Mutambe Bunene wa mu diulu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meme, Nebukadenesâ, nakadi nshikama talalâ mu nsubu muanyi, nakadi ne diakalengele mu mbalasa wanyi wa bukelenge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakalota tshilota tshiakankuatshisha buowa; meji anakadi ngela munda ha bulalu buanyi ne bikena kumona binakamona ku mutu wanyi biakantatshisha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku nakela mukenji ne, Balue ne bena meji bonso ba mu Babulona ku mpala kuanyi, bua bobo bamanye mua kummanyisha dijingulula dia tshilota tshianyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe, bena mbuku, bena buloshi, Bena Kasada ne bamanyi ba malu a mitoto bakalua ku mpala kuanyi; nakabawila tshilota, kadi kabakamanya mua kummanyisha dijingulula diatshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi ku nyima Danyele, udibo babikila ne Beleteshasâ, bu mudi dina diandi dia nzambi wanyi, ne udi ne nyuma wa nzambi ya tshijila munda muandi, wakalua ku mpala kuanyi. Nakamuawila tshilota tshianyi ne, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wewe, Beleteshasâ, kahita ka batempi ba mbuku, bualu bua ndi mumanye ne nyuma wa nzambi ya tshijila udi munda muebe, ne kakuena bualu busokoka budi bukukolela, ungambile bikena kumona binakumona mu tshilota tshianyi ne dijingulula diabi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bikena kumona binakamona ku mutu wanyi hanakadi mu bulalu buanyi biakadi nunku: Nakatangila, ekumona, mutshi wakadi munkatshi mua buloba; bule buau buakadi buhite! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutshi wakadiunda, wakalua mukole, lusongo luau luakafika mu diulu, wakamueneka kudi ba kunfudilu kua buloba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mabeshi au akadi malengele, mamuma au akadi a bungi be, akadi makumbane bia kudia bia bantu bonso. Nyama ya mu mpata yakalala mu dileshi diau, nyunyu ya mulu yakikila ha matamba au ne bonso bakadi ne muoyo bakadia bia kudia kudiu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu bikena kumona bia ku mutu wanyi binakadi nʼabi mu bulalu buanyi nakatangila, ekumona, mutangidi, muntu wa tshijila, uhueka hanshi, mufume mu diulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye wakela dî dikole, wamba ne, Shimbulai mutshi eu, kosai matamba au, hoholai mabeshi au, tangalashai mamuma au! Nyama yumuke muinshi muau, nyunyu idi ha matamba au ibuke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi shiyai tshikuku ne miji yatshi mu buloba, tshisuikibue ne mukaba wa tshiamu tshifike ne wa tshiamu tshia mitaku, munkatshi mua mashinde a lutende. Muntu au aboleshibue ne dibungi dia mulu, adie mashinde a mu mpata bu nyama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutshima wandi wa buntu wandamuke bu wa nyama; ashale nunku bidimu muanda mutekete. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dikosa dia bualu ebu didi difume ku mukenji wa batangidi ne ku dilomba dia ba tshijila; bua bonso badi ne muoyo bamanye ne Mutambe Bunene wa mu dilulu udi ukokesha bukelenge bua bantu, udi ubuhesha muntu yonso udiye musue, udi uteka muntu mutambe buhuekele ku mutu kuabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tshilota etshi ntshiotshi tshinakulota, meme, Mukelenge Nebukadenesâ; ne wewe, Beleteshasâ, ungambile dijingulula diatshi, bualu bua bena meji bonso ba mu bukelenge buanyi kabena bamanye mua kundesha dijingulula diatshi. Kadi wewe udi mumanye mua kuenza nunku, bualu bua nyuma wa nzambi ya tshijila udi munda muebe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe, Danyele, udibo babikila ne, Beleteshasâ, wakadi ne mutshima muhandike tô tshituha tshia diba, ne meji andi akamutatshisha. Mukelenge wakamuambila ne, Beleteshasâ, tshilota etshi ne dijingulula diatshi kabikutatshishi nansha. Beleteshasâ wakamukudimuna ne, Mukelenge wanyi, tshilota etshi tshikale kudi badi nʼebe lukuna, ne dijingulula diatshi dikale kudi badi basue kukunyoka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutshi au uwakamona, wakadiunda tô ne hakaluau mimene ne mukole, lusongo luau luakafika mu diulu, wakamueneka kudi ba kunfudilu kua buloba; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mabeshi au akadi malengele, mamuma au akadi a bungi, akadi makumbane bia kudia bia bantu bonso; mu dileshi diau muakadi nyama ya mu mpata ilala, ne munkatshi mua matamba au nyunyu ya mulu yakadi ne miaba ya kuikila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutshi eu nguewe muine, mukelenge. Wewe wakudiunda mimene ne mukole; bualu bua bunene buebe buakuhita bunene, budi bufika tô ne mu diulu, bukokeshi buebe budi bufika tô ne kunfudilu kua buloba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukelenge wakamona mutangidi, muntu wa tshijila, uhueka hanshi mufume mu diulu, wamba ne, Shimbulai mutshi eu, ûkosololai; kadi shiyai tshikuku ne miji yatshi mu buloba, tshisuikibue ne mukaba wa tshiamu tshifike ne wa tshiamu tshia mitaku, munkatshi mua mashinde a lutende; muntu au aboleshibue ne dibungi dia mulu; adie mashinde a mu mpata bu nyama tô ne hahita bidimu muanda mutekete. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Edi ndijingulula dia tshilota, mukelenge, ne edi ndî dia Mutambe Bunene wa mu diulu, diakulua kudi mukelenge wanyi: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nebakuihate munkatshi mua bantu, neushikame ne nyama ya mu mpata, neudie mashinde bu mudi ngombe idia; neuboleshibue ne dibungi dia mulu. Bidimu muanda mutekete nebihie tô ne hawamanya ne, Mutambe Bunene wa mu diulu udi ukokesha bukelenge bua bantu, ne udi ubuhesha muntu yonso udiye musue. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bu muakelabo mukenji bua kushiya tshikuku tshia mutshi ne miji yatshi, bukelenge buebe nebuikale kûdi hawamanya ne wa mu diulu nyeye muine udi ukokesha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bua muanda eu, mukelenge wanyi, wanji kuitabusha lungenyi luanyi: ulekele mibi yebe, uhingashe bienzedi biakane mu muaba wai; ulekele malu ebe a tshishiku, ufuile bahele luse; nunku, bumue, diakalengele diebe nedileheshibue.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Malu â onso akakuata mukelenge Nebukadenesâ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakahita ngondo dikumi ne ibidi, yeye wakadi wendakana mu mbalasa wa bukelenge mu province wa Babulona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukelenge wakamba ne, Eu Babulona mimene, tshiakuibaka musoko eu bu muaba wa mukelenge kushikameye ku bukole buanyi bunene bua mpete butumbi ne buneme, anyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakatshidi mei â mukana mua mukelenge, dî diakafuma mu diulu ne, Mukelenge Nebukadenesâ, badi bakuambila wewe muine ne, Bukelenge buakumuka kûdi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebakuihate munkatshi mua bantu, neushikame ne nyama ya mu mpata; neudie mashinde bu mudi ngombe idia; ne bidimu muanda mutekete nebihite tô ne hawamanya ne, Mutambe Bunene wa mu diulu udi ukokesha bukelenge bua bantu, ne udi ubuhesha muntu yonso udiye musue. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu diba adi mene bualu abu buakakuata Nebukadenesâ. Bakamuihata munkatshi mua bantu, wakadia mashinde bu mudi ngombe idia. Mubidi wandi wakabola ne dibungi dia mulu, tô ne hakaleha nsuki yandi bu masala a nyunyu wa mukanku, ne nzadi yakalua bu nzadi ya nyunyu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
